OL,3,GNEWSAAdventurer 'wobbly' but well after
OL,4,A327 days at sea
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former Royal Marine who rowed solo
OL,7,Facross the Pacific and Indian Ocean
OL,8,Fsays life has been "quite a whirlwind"
OL,9,Fsince he stepped ashore in Kenya.
OL,11,FDave "Dinger" Bell, from Bere Regis in
OL,12,FDorset, arrived in Kilifi to a hero's
OL,13,Fwelcome on Friday after 327 days
OL,14,Frowing, unsupported, from Peru, across
OL,15,Fthe Pacific and Indian Ocean.
OL,17,FHe said, after nearly 11 months at sea,
OL,18,Fhe had trouble balancing at first but
OL,19,Fwas otherwise well.
